{"hw":"ἀμείνων","html":"<div class=\"lex-entry\"><h4 class=\"lex-hw gk\">ἀμείνων</h4><span class=\"lex-orth gk\">ἀμείνων</span>, <span class=\"lex-itype gk\">ον</span>, gen. <span class=\"lex-itype gk\">ονος</span>, irreg. <span class=\"lex-gram\"> <span class=\"lex-gram\">Comp. of</span> </span> <span class=\"gk\">ἀγαθός,</span> <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"1\"><span class=\"lex-n\">A</span> <b class=\"lex-tr\">better:</b> </div> <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"2\"><span class=\"lex-n\">I</span> of persons, <b class=\"lex-tr\">stouter, stronger, braver,</b> freq. <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Hom.</span> </span>, etc.: <span class=\"gk\">μέγ' ἀ.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Il.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">22.158</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">πολλὸν ἀ.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Hes.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Op.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">19</span> </span>: c. acc. vel <span class=\"lex-gram\">inf.</span>, <span class=\"gk\">ἀμείνων παντοίας ἀρετάς, ἠμὲν πόδας ἠδὲ μάχεσθαι</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Il.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">15.641</span> </span>, cf. <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Hes.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Op.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">445</span> </span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">A.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Pr.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">337</span> </span>, etc.; <span class=\"gk\">ο&lt;*( ἀμείνονες</span> <b class=\"lex-tr\">the better sort,</b> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Pl.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Lg.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">627a</span> </span>. </div> <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"2\"><span class=\"lex-n\">II</span> of things, <span class=\"gk\">ὀμίχλην νυκτὸς ἀμείνω</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Il.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">3.11</span> </span>; esp. from <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Hom.</span> </span> downwds., <span class=\"gk\">ἄμεινόν [ἐστι]</span> <b class=\"lex-tr\">'tis better,</b> either c. <span class=\"lex-gram\">inf.</span>, <span class=\"gk\">ἐπεὶ πείθεσθαι ἄ.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Il.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">1.274</span> </span>, cf. <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">S.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">El.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">1238</span> </span>, etc.; or <span class=\"gk\">ἄμεινόν ἐστι</span> or <span class=\"gk\">γίγνεταί τινι</span> c. <span class=\"lex-gram\">part.</span>, <span class=\"gk\">εἴ σφι ἄμεινον γίγνεται τιμωρέουσι</span> if <b class=\"lex-tr\">it is good</b> for them to assist, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Hdt.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">7.169</span> </span>, cf. <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Th.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">1.118</span> </span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">6.9</span> </span>: abs., <span class=\"gk\">εἰ τό γ' ἄ.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Il.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">1.116</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">βουλοίμην.. εἴ τι ἄ. καὶ ὑμῖν καὶ ἐμοί</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Pl.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Ap.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">19a</span> </span>; freq. with neg., <span class=\"gk\">οὐ γὰρ ἄ.</span> 'twere <b class=\"lex-tr\">better</b> not, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Hes.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Op.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">750</span> </span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Hdt.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">1.187</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">εἰρήσεται γάρ, εἴτ' ἄ. εἴτε μή</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">D.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">21.198</span> </span>. </div> <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"3\"><span class=\"lex-n\">2</span> neut. as <span class=\"lex-gram\">Adv.</span>, <span class=\"gk\">ἄ. πρήσσειν</span> to fare <b class=\"lex-tr\">better,</b> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Hdt.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">4.156</span> </span> sq., etc.; <span class=\"gk\">συνήνεικεν Ἀθηναίοις ἐπὶ τὸ ἄ.</span> Decr. ap. <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">And.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">1.77</span> </span>, cf. Orac. ap. <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">D.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">43.86</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">τὰ ἀμείνω φρονέειν</span> choose the <b class=\"lex-tr\">better part,</b> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Hdt.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">7.145</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">τοῖσι τὰ ἀ. ἑάνδανε</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Id.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">9.19</span> </span>. </div> <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"2\"><span class=\"lex-n\">III</span> <span class=\"lex-gram\">Adv.</span> <span class=\"gk\">ἀμεινόνως</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Ar.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Fr.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">340</span> </span>. </div> <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"2\"><span class=\"lex-n\">IV</span> new <span class=\"lex-gram\"> <span class=\"lex-gram\">Comp.</span> </span> <span class=\"gk\">ἀμεινότερος, <span class=\"lex-itype gk\">α</span>, <span class=\"lex-itype gk\">ον</span>,</span> formed from <span class=\"gk\">ἀμείνων,</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Mimn.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">14.9</span> </span>, Poet. ap. <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Phld.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Rh.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">2.61S.</span> </span>&lt;</div></div>"}